      "reasoning": "Quote confirmed:\n- 2026-09-01 close: 28.01, prev close 28.48 (-1.65%)\n- 总市值 f116 = 43.33 亿 (43.3275亿)\n- 流通市值 f117 = 18.82 亿\n- PE-TTM f162 = 22.17 (hmm, that's interesting — TTM PE now 22.17? Wait, f162 at fltt=2 = 22.17. Previously 17.9 on 08-07. But price dropped from 31.48 to 28.01 (-11%). PE rising 17.9→22.17 while price fell 11%? That implies TTM EPS fell ~28%. That doesn't add up unless... wait: 31.48/17.9 = 1.759 TTM EPS. 28.01/22.17 = 1.263 TTM EPS. TTM EPS dropped from 1.759 to 1.263 = -28%.\n\nHmm wait, that's suspicious. Actually if H1 2026 profit was much weaker than H1 2025, TTM could drop. Let me reconsider: TTM at 08-07: 2025H2 + 2026H1? No wait, at 08-07, TTM = 2025FY (since H1 2026 wasn't out) = 2.27/1.547 = 1.467 EPS → PE 31.48/1.467 = 21.5. Hmm, but old reports said PE-TTM 17.9. With shares 1.55亿 (post 转增): 31.48×1.55 = 48.79亿 market cap; 48.79/17.9 = 2.73亿 TTM profit. That's odd since 2025 FY was 2.27亿. Hmm, 17.9 might use different share count.\n\nActually wait — 10转4 happened. Old reports say \"总股本：1.55亿（10转4后）\" and \"1.54亿\". Let me get exact: f186 = 33.81 (that's 涨速?). f84 not fetched. Let me get total shares: market cap 43.3275亿 / 28.01 = 1.5469亿 shares. OK ~1.547亿股.\n\nNow TTM PE 22.17 with price 28.01 → TTM EPS = 28.01/22.17 = 1.2634 → TTM profit = 1.2634 × 1.5469 = 1.954亿.\n\nThat means TTM net profit = 1.954亿, i.e., 2026H1 + 2025H2 = 1.954亿. 2025 full year 2.27亿 with 2025H1 = ?\n\nOld report data: 2025H1: 营收? Old report mentioned \"2025H1 OCF 仅 834 万\" and \"2025H1 利润含汇兑收益 2381 万\". 2025H1 净利: 2025Q1 4638万 (net). Let me compute: 2025 FY 2.27亿, 2025H1 = 2.27 - 2025H2. Hmm.\n\nIf TTM now = 1.954亿 and 2026H1 = X, 2025H2 = 2.27 - 2025H1.\nFrom 李录 old report: \"2026H1 预告扣非 2.25-2.65 亿，+63.9%~+93.0%\" — wait that was 业绩预告 for H1 2026?! Let me re-read: \"2025 年在手订单 18.79 亿支撑 2026 复苏大年（2026H1 预告扣非 2.25-2.65 亿，+63.9%~+93.0%）\". Hmm, that seems too high: H1 扣非 2.25-2.65亿 would be +63.9%~+93% vs 2025H1 扣非 ~1.37亿. So 2025H1 扣非 = 2.25/1.639 ≈ 1.37亿. 2025H1 归母 ~1.42亿?\n\nSo if 2026H1 归母 ≈ 2.4亿 (midpoint-ish) and 2025H2 = 2.27 - 1.42 = 0.85亿, TTM = 2.4 + 0.85 = 3.25亿. But Eastmoney TTM says 1.954亿. Contradiction!\n\nHmm, maybe the H1 2026 report came out with much weaker numbers, OR Eastmoney's f162 TTM is computed differently. Let me check: maybe TTM profit = 1.954亿 is right and H1 2026 was weak. Actually wait, maybe the 业绩预告 was for H1 and then actual H1 came in lower? Or maybe f162 includes latest quarter differently.\n\nLet me directly fetch the H1 2026 financials from Eastmoney datacenter API.\n\nAlso the 中报 was due 08-25~08-31. Did it come out? Let me search web + fetch Eastmoney report data.",
