        "text": "Critical finding: The H1 2026 中报 was released on 2026-08-24 (per 蓝鲸) / 08-25 (per 机构风向标). Key data:\n\n- 2026H1 营收 6.62亿, +6.27%\n- 2026H1 归母净利 9770.24万, **-20.33%**\n- Q2 单季: 营收 3.08亿, **-28.32%**; 归母 640.97万, **-91.59%**\n- 增收不增利: 汇兑损失增加 + 产品结构变化\n- 经营现金流大幅净流出\n- 三费占比上升明显\n\nThis is a MAJOR fundamental change vs the old reports' assumptions:\n- Old reports assumed 2026 = 复苏大年 (机构 2026E 3.11亿, +36.7%), Q1 +96.84% was \"低基数+外销提升\"\n- Reality: H1 归母 9770万 -20.33%. Q1 was 9129万 +96.8%, so Q2 was only 641万 (-91.6%)! The H1 total 9770万 means Q2 alone = 9770 - 9129 = 641万. Wait: 2026Q1 归母 9129万, 2026H1 9770万 → Q2 归母 = 641万. Yes! Q2 单季归母 640.97万, -91.59%.\n\nSo Q2 collapsed. H1 -20.33%. This falsifies the \"复苏大年\" thesis — the old reports' 验证窗口 concern (\"Q1 单季增速不可外推\") was validated: Q2 单季增速 -91.59%.\n\nAlso: 2026H1 预告 was 扣非 2.25-2.65亿 +63.9%~+93%?? That seems inconsistent with actual 扣非. Wait, that预告 in 李录 report said \"2026H1 预告扣非 2.25-2.65 亿，+63.9%~+93.0%\". Hmm, that doesn't match actual H1 归母 9770万. Let me re-read: \"2025 年在手订单 18.79 亿支撑 2026 复苏大年（2026H1 预告扣非 2.25-2.65 亿，+63.9%~+93.0%）\". That would be wrong vs actual. Maybe the old report misquoted the 预告 (maybe it was 0.225-0.265亿? or it was H1 预告 of something else). Anyway, actual H1 2026: 归母 0.977亿 -20.3%. The 预告 was likely 归母 0.92-1.08亿 or something. Actually more likely the 预告 said \"2026H1 扣非 0.225-0.265亿\"? No — +63.9% on what base... 2025H1 扣非: if H1 2025 归母 = 9770/(1-0.2033) = 12263万 (1.226亿), 扣非 similar. Hmm.\n\nWhatever — I need the precise H1 numbers. Let me fetch from Eastmoney with correct sort column, and fetch the actual 半年报 details including OCF, contract liabilities, gross margin, etc.\n\nEastmoney RPT_LICO_FN_CPD failed with sort column. Use sortColumns: REPORTDATE? The correct field names for RPT_LICO_FN_CPD: REPORTDATE, TOTAL_OPERATE_INCOME, YSTZ (营收同比), PARENT_NETPROFIT, SJLTZ (净利同比), DEDUCT_PARENT_NETPROFIT, BASIC_EPS, BPS, ROE_WEIGHT, MGJYXJJE (每股经营现金流), XSMLL (销售毛利率), ASSET_LIAB_RATIO, NOTICE_DATE, TOTALOPERATEREVE... Let me just use sortColumns=-REPORTDATE.\n\nAlso fetch:\n- H1 balance sheet (contract liabilities 合同负债)\n- H1 cash flow statement (OCF)\n- Q2 quarterly: revenue 3.08亿 (-28.32%), 归母 640.97万 (-91.59%)\n\nLet me also verify with a second source (新浪/同花顺/证券之星) — cross-validate via financial_rigor.\n\nFirst fetch Eastmoney data properly."
