        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Excellent. Eastmoney confirmed (source 1):\n\n**2026H1 (中报, 公告 2026-08-25):**\n- 营收 6.618亿, +6.27%\n- 归母净利 9770.24万, **-20.33%**\n- 基本EPS 0.63元 (H1)\n- BPS 16.91元\n- 毛利率 33.81% (vs 2025H1 33.93%, vs 2026Q1 44.31%)\n- 每股经营现金流 -0.7976元 → H1 OCF = -0.7976 × 1.547亿 ≈ -1.234亿\n- 公告日期 2026-08-25\n\n**Q2 单季 (derived):** 营收 = 6.618 - 3.536 = 3.082亿 (-28.32% per 证券之星 ✓), 归母 = 9770 - 9129 = 641万 (-91.59% per 证券之星 ✓). Q2 毛利率: (6.618×0.3381 - 3.536×0.4431)/3.082 = (2.2377 - 1.5669)/3.082 = 0.6708/3.082 = 21.8%. Hmm interesting, Q2 gross margin collapsed to ~21.8%. Wait let me verify: H1 毛利 = 6.6184×33.81% = 2.2378亿. Q1 毛利 = 3.5362×44.31% = 1.5669亿. Q2 毛利 = 0.6709亿 → Q2 毛利率 = 0.6709/3.0818 = 21.77%. That's a big drop (产品结构变化+汇兑).\n\nAlso 2026Q1 EPS 0.83?? Wait: Q1 归母 9129万, 总股本 1.547亿 → EPS = 0.59. But Eastmoney says BASIC_EPS 0.83 for Q1 and 0.63 for H1? That's inconsistent. Hmm. Actually wait — Eastmoney 的 BASIC_EPS for Q1 shows 0.83, H1 shows 0.63. 9129万/1.547亿 = 0.590. So 0.83 doesn't match either. Unless share count is smaller: 9129万/0.83 = 1.10亿股. Hmm. And 9770万/0.63 = 1.551亿股. Inconsistent.\n\nWait, actually maybe BASIC_EPS Q1=0.83 is wrong in Eastmoney (maybe it's per some other base) or Q1 EPS was reported on pre-转增 basis? The 10转4 was in 2025年度 (2026-06 ex-date?). Hmm. Let me not rely on Eastmoney BASIC_EPS; compute from 归母/股本.\n\nActually wait — check 2025-03-31: 归母 4638万, EPS 0.42 → 1.104亿股. And 2025-06-30: 归母 1.226亿, EPS 0.8 → 1.533亿股. Inconsistent. 2025-09-30: 1.996亿/1.814 = 1.10亿股. 2025-12-31: 2.273亿/2.06 = 1.103亿股. So year-end figures use 1.103亿股?? That means at 2025 年报, total shares = 1.103亿?? But then 转增 happened during 2026? No wait — 10转4 was implemented in 2025 中期? Let me think.\n\nOld reports said: \"总股本：1.55亿（10转4后）\" and \"1.54亿（10转4后）\", and 李录 said \"总股本 1.547 亿股\". Also market cap 43.33亿/28.01 = 1.5469亿 shares. So current total shares = 1.547亿.\n\nBut Eastmoney BASIC_EPS uses 1.10亿 for 2025 periods?? That suggests the EPS figures are computed on pre-转增 share base, which is unusual (usually EPS gets restated). Hmm, wait: maybe the 10转4 happened in 2026 (e.g., ex-date 2026-06). Old 段永平 report said \"2025年度10转4派5元\" — the 2025 年度分红方案, implemented in 2026 (ex-date ~2026-05/06). At 2025 年报 (公告 2026-04-27), total shares were still 1.103亿. After 转增 ex-date, shares became 1.547亿. Hmm, but old reports from 08-10/08-11 already said \"总股本 1.55亿（10转4后）\". And 李录 said \"IPO 三年后 73% 股份刚解禁\" hmm.\n\nWait, but there's a discrepancy: 2026Q1 (公告 2026-04-27, same day as 年报) BASIC_EPS 0.83: 9129万/0.83 = 1.10亿股 — consistent with pre-转增 shares at that time. H1 2026 (公告 08-25): 9770万/0.63 = 1.551亿 — post-转增. So the 转增 ex-date was between 2026-04-27 and 2026-08-25. So at 2026Q1, shares were 1.103亿; now 1.547亿.\n\nHold on — but that contradicts 段永平 old report: \"总股本：1.55亿（10转4后）\" dated 08-11 — consistent: by August, 转增 done. And \"2025年度10转4派5元\" — but wait, old 财务估值 report said 2025年度分红: 10转4派5元 with 中期 10派3元. Hmm, and 李录 said \"2025-09-24 解禁 8100 万股（占总股本 73.31%）\" — 8100万/73.31% = 1.105亿 total shares at 2025-09. Yes! So pre-转增 shares = 1.105亿; post = 1.547亿. 转增 ex-date likely 2026-06-ish.\n\nOK so current share base 1.547亿. EPS calculations:\n- 2026H1 EPS = 9770万/1.547亿 = 0.632 ✓ (matches 0.63)\n- 2026Q1 EPS = 9129万/1.547亿 = 0.590 (Eastmoney 0.83 is stale pre-转增 base)\n- 2025FY EPS = 2.273亿/1.547亿 = 1.469 (Eastmoney 2.06 on 1.10亿 base)\n\nTTM 归母 = 2025H2 + 2026H1 = (2.273 - 1.226) + 0.977 = 1.047 + 0.977 = 2.024亿. TTM EPS = 2.024/1.547 = 1.308. PE-TTM = 28.01/1.308 = 21.4. Eastmoney f162 said 22.17 (they use their own TTM computation, maybe slight diff in H2 2025: 2.273-1.2263=1.0467; +0.9770 = 2.0237 → EPS 1.3082 → PE 21.41). Eastmoney 22.17 → TTM EPS 1.2634 → TTM profit 1.954亿. Slight difference (maybe they use 扣非 or different rounding). Whatever — PE-TTM ≈ 21.4-22.2. I'll compute precisely with financial_rigor calc.\n\nKey numbers for H1 2026 (中报):\n- 营收 6.62亿 +6.27% (Q1 +83.4%, Q2 -28.3%)\n- 归母 9770万 -20.33% (Q1 +96.8%, Q2 -91.6%)\n- 扣非? Need to fetch. 腾讯新闻 says 归母 -20.33%. Let me get 扣非 from Eastmoney (field name maybe KCFJCXSYJLR didn't appear — only TOTAL_OPERATE_INCOME, YSTZ, PARENT_NETPROFIT, SJLTZ, BASIC_EPS, BPS, XSMLL, MGJYXJJE, NOTICE_DATE were printed). Let me print all keys for the H1 row.\n- OCF: 每股 -0.7976 → H1 OCF ≈ -1.23亿 (Q1 was -6414万, so Q2 ≈ -0.59亿)\n- 毛利率 H1 33.81% (vs Q1 44.31% → Q2 ~21.8%)\n- 三费占比上升 (财务费用增加 - 汇兑损失)\n\nNow I need:\n1. Full H1 row fields (扣非, 财务费用, 汇兑)\n2. Balance sheet H1: 合同负债, 存货, 应收账款, 货币资金\n3. Cash flow statement H1: OCF exact value\n4. Second source for cross-validation: 新浪/证券之星/同花顺 H1 data\n\nEastmoney API for balance sheet: RPT_DMSK_FN_BALANCE (资产负债表), RPT_DMSK_FN_CASHFLOW (现金流量表), RPT_DMSK_FN_INCOME (利润表). Or use the f10 API: https://emweb.securities.eastmoney.com/PC_HSF10/NewFinanceAnalysis/...\n\nLet me fetch the H1 report financial statements from Eastmoney f10 API (zcfzb, xjllb, lrb)."
