x; that assumed 2026 恢复 14-15亿营收 × 19% 净利率. Now H1 shows 毛利率 33.8% (down from Q1 44.3%), 净利率 14.8% (H1). If full-year 2026: H1 0.977 + H2 ~1.0 = ~2.0亿. 正常化中枢 must be revised down from 2.7-2.85 to ~2.0-2.3亿.\n\nLet me now think about what each view's 建仓价 should be. The views must independently derive. Also each view must have at least one independent new observation point.\n\nAlso cross-validate with financial_rigor: \n- 2026H1 归母净利: Eastmoney 9770.24万 vs 证券之星/腾讯 (9770.24万) — need second source numeric. 证券之星 said 9770.24万 ✓. Also 蓝鲸 said 6.62亿 营收 +6.27%. I should fetch one more source: 新浪 or 同花顺 API for H1. Let me try 新浪财务 or just use the sohu article numbers as source 2. Better: fetch 同花顺 basic? Let me do cross-validate with values from Eastmoney (0.9770亿) vs 证券之星 (0.9770亿) — same. Try another: Tushare income returned [] — maybe tushare token works with ts-code. Let me check financial_rigor's --ts-code option: cross-validate supports --ts-code 001332.SZ to auto-fetch Tushare. Let me try that.\n\nNow the price baseline: 2026-09-01 close 28.01 (Tencent + Eastmoney both 28.01 ✓). Multi-source confirmed.\n\nMarket cap = 28.01 × 1.547亿 = 43.33亿 ✓ (Eastmoney f116 43.33亿 ✓).\n\nShare count verification: 43.3275/28.01 = 1.5469亿. Let me get exact share count: 1,105,000,000...? Pre-转增 1.105亿 × 1.4 = 1.547亿. Let me verify: old 李录 report says 总股本 1.547亿股. OK.\n\nActually wait — Eastmoney f186 = 33.81 (PE-TTM? no that's 涨速). f116 total mkt cap = 43.33亿, f117 float = 18.82亿. Float 18.82/28.01 = 0.672亿股 float. Hmm, that seems small — but 曹洪海 holds 57.99% (locked), so float is small. OK.\n\nTTM EPS calc: TTM 归母 = 2025H2 + 2026H1 = (2.27298 - 1.22629) + 0.97702 = 1.04669 + 0.97702 = 2.02371亿. TTM EPS = 2.02371/1.547 = 1.3082. PE-TTM = 28.01/1.3082 = 21.41. Eastmoney f162=22.17 uses different TTM (maybe 扣非 or different share count). PE-TTM (归母, 转增后股本) = 21.4.\n\nNow let me also verify 2026H1 数据 from a second source (证券之星 via 腾讯新闻 article, or 同花顺). Let me quickly fetch the 证券之星 simplified analysis article numbers — already have from search results: 营收 6.62亿 +6.27%, 归母 9770.24万 -20.33%, Q2 营收 3.08亿 -28.32%, Q2 归母 640.97万 -91.59%. That matches Eastmoney derived Q2 (6.618-3.536=3.082亿; 9770-9129=641万 ✓✓). Good — two sources agree.\n\nAlso fetch 一季报+中报 from 新浪 finance API as third source? The 新浪 financial statements API: https://money.finance.sina.com.cn/corp/go.php/vFD_FinancialGuideLine/stockid/001332/ctrl/2026/displaytype/4.phtml — returns HTML. Maybe skip; two sources + Eastmoney datacenter + Tushare attempt is enough. But 强制数据核验 requires running financial_rigor.py cross-validate with real values. Let me run:\n\n1. cross-validate 2026H1归母净利: {\"东方财富\":0.9770,\"证券之星\":0.9770} \n2. cross-validate 2026H1营收: {\"东方财富\":6.6184,\"证券之星\":6.62}\n3. Try --ts-code 001332.SZ for Tushare supplement.\n4. verify-market-cap --price 28.01 --shares 1.547 --reported 43.33\n5. verify-valuation --price 28.01 --eps 1.308 --bvps 16.91\n6. three-scenario for 巴菲特 perspective.\n\nAlso check the Q2 单季 毛利率 21.8% derived — cross-check via 蓝鲸 article: \"受汇兑损失增加及产品结构变化影响\" ✓.\n\nNow — team workflow. The skill wants 4 parallel agents via Team tool. But memory says: \"Agent 带 name 参数会报 No active team；investment-team 用无 name 的后台 Agent 替代团队模式\". Also env_tool_permissions memory. Let me read that memory to confirm the agent spawning pattern.",
